ists, so importing data and type-mismatch rejection cannot be performed.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Priority renders as input[type=number]. Pressing \\\"a\\\" left the value at \\\"0\\\" (no non-numeric text accepted); Playwright fill(\\\"abc\\\") was rejected outright. Valid value 9 was accepted and saved, displayed as \\\"9\\\" in table and card.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Due Date renders as input[type=date]. Setting \\\"2026-02-31\\\" (invalid calendar date) resulted in value \\\"\\\" — not saved. Valid \\\"2026-03-07\\\" was accepted and displayed as \\\"Mar 7, 2026\\\" in both views.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Count stayed \\\"6 entries\\\" across asc and desc sorts. Every field value unchanged, e.g. Zebra QA test entry 9/Mar 7 2026/Yes/QA note alpha, Team sync meeting notes 2/Jan 14 2026/Yes/—, Design new landing page 1/Jan 15 2026/No/—. Only ordering differed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Cannot verify filter inclusion/clearing because filtering does not exist\", \"actual\": \"No filter criteria can be applied at all (no filter control anywhere in the DOM), so there is no active-criteria matching to evaluate and no \\\"clear filters\\\" action to restore data.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All 6 entries and all 5 fields render in both views. Empty Notes values are shown as an em dash \\\"—\\\" in table cells and in card field values, a clear empty representation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Field-type dropdown lists labeled options \\\"Text\\\", \\\"Number\\\", \\\"Date\\\", \\\"Checkbox\\\". Entry form renders input