    "content": "All 18 checklist items have been tested and recorded.\n\n## Summary\n\n**13 PASS / 5 FAIL** on FlexBase (http://localhost:6074/)\n\n### Failures\n\n| ID | Issue |\n|---|---|\n| **FT-1** | **No persistence.** New entries and added fields appear immediately, but a page reload wipes everything back to the 5 seed entries. `localStorage` is completely empty — nothing is saved. |\n| **FT-6** | **Filtering does not exist.** No filter control anywhere in the DOM; a text scan for `/filter/i` matched only CSS. Only a global search box is available, which is not field-specific. |\n| **CS-12** | Consequence of FT-6 — no criteria can be applied or cleared, so inclusion/restore semantics are untestable. |\n| **FT-19** | **Import does not exist.** Zero `input[type=file]`, no Import/Upload/CSV control — despite the Fields dialog explicitly advising \"Configure fields before importing data.\" |\n| **CS-20** | **Search matches raw values, not displayed ones.** `\"Mar 7\"` → 0 results while raw `\"2026-03-07\"` → 1; `\"Yes\"` → 0 results while raw `\"true\"` → 3. Searching `\"No\"` returned only incidental text substring hits (\"...notes\", \"QA note...\") and missed every actually-unchecked entry. |\n\n### Notable passes\nField configuration with all four labeled types works, entry forms render type-appropriate controls, both views render data consistently (empty values as `—`), and number/date inputs correctly reject `abc` and `2026-02-31`.\n\nThe two \"independent state\" behaviors described in the instructions both hold up: **sort** (Cards on Priority↓ vs Table on Task Name↑) and **manual drag order** (Table `[Review, Design, Update…]` vs Cards `[Review, Update, Design…]`) are each maintained separately across view switches.\n\nOne caveat worth flagging: the instructions state sort states are \"saved automatically,\" but given FT-1's total lack of persistence, that saving is in-memory only and is lost on reload."
  }
